{"unit_id":"cjx12036__TaskWatch#card-zh","repo":"cjx12036/TaskWatch","commit":"fff171a7f5edaa9544b02ff1a50a909924041a64","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"TaskWatch 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的任务意图监督插件。它接入会话与模型能力，在侧栏展示任务目标、要求、执行记录和监督报告，并把任务意图、公开执行证据与模型建议分开保存。用户可按项目和任务授权观察，查看用量与检查点，也可在明确同意后启用 coach 建议。插件还支持管理目标变更与共享目标提取。适合希望跟踪编码代理是否仍按原任务推进的 DSH 用户；需要配置监督模型，并使用本地账本保存状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugins/taskwatch/index.mjs:72-105","packages/sidebar/service.mjs:72-88"]}
{"unit_id":"cjx12036__TaskWatch#card-en","repo":"cjx12036/TaskWatch","commit":"fff171a7f5edaa9544b02ff1a50a909924041a64","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"TaskWatch is a DSH web plugin for tracking task intent against execution evidence. Its sidebar displays goals, requirements, history, and reports. Users can authorize task observation and consent to coach suggestions. Configure a supervision model; state is stored in a local ledger.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugins/taskwatch/index.mjs:72-105","packages/sidebar/service.mjs:72-88"]}
