{"unit_id":"cjx12036__TaskWatch#feature-1","repo":"cjx12036/TaskWatch","commit":"fff171a7f5edaa9544b02ff1a50a909924041a64","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**TaskWatch** 的功能「意图与证据跟踪」：把用户消息提取为目标和要求，并与可见执行证据分开记录；侧栏展示当前意图版本和执行历史。 通过 DSH 侧栏触发或查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/intent/extract.mjs:20-40","packages/sidebar/service.mjs:86-88"]}
{"unit_id":"cjx12036__TaskWatch#feature-2","repo":"cjx12036/TaskWatch","commit":"fff171a7f5edaa9544b02ff1a50a909924041a64","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**TaskWatch** 的功能「监督检查点」：在用户消息、助手回复、工具结果或回合结束等检查点调度观察，并在侧栏查看检查状态。 通过 DSH 侧栏触发或查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/observe/checkpoint-scheduler.mjs:18-42","packages/sidebar/service.mjs:72-88"]}
{"unit_id":"cjx12036__TaskWatch#feature-3","repo":"cjx12036/TaskWatch","commit":"fff171a7f5edaa9544b02ff1a50a909924041a64","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**TaskWatch** 的功能「授权观察与报告」：用户配置监督模型并启用项目、同意具体任务后，插件启动观察并在侧栏提供状态和报告。 通过 DSH 侧栏触发或查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/sidebar/service.mjs:30-56","packages/sidebar/service.mjs:90-97"]}
{"unit_id":"cjx12036__TaskWatch#feature-4","repo":"cjx12036/TaskWatch","commit":"fff171a7f5edaa9544b02ff1a50a909924041a64","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**TaskWatch** 的功能「Coach 建议」：对有证据的偏差或取舍生成建议；发送前检查任务同意、建议有效期和主 Agent 运行状态，需批准的建议等待确认。 通过 DSH 侧栏触发或查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/coach/suggestions.mjs:26-38","packages/coach/suggestions.mjs:43-55"]}
{"unit_id":"cjx12036__TaskWatch#feature-5","repo":"cjx12036/TaskWatch","commit":"fff171a7f5edaa9544b02ff1a50a909924041a64","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**TaskWatch** 的功能「侧栏任务控制」：侧栏接口支持暂停、恢复、回答澄清卡和分页查看任务数据，并对请求载荷作字段检查。 通过 DSH 侧栏触发或查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugins/taskwatch/web.mjs:7-24","plugins/taskwatch/web.mjs:42-62"]}
